OL,3,GNEWSAPolice confiscate #1m from jailed
OL,4,Adrug dealers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne million pounds has been confiscated
OL,7,Ffrom two prisoners who were involved in
OL,8,Fsupplying "bulk volumes of drugs" in a
OL,9,Fcounty.
OL,11,FSimon Renoldi, 55, and Iain Green, 56,
OL,12,Fused EncroChat, an encrypted global
OL,13,Fcommunication service, to supply bulk
OL,14,Fvolumes of drugs in Essex in 2020 and
OL,15,F2021.
OL,17,FEssex Police said the pair have seen
OL,18,Fassets of #1,039,748.08 confiscated
OL,19,Fbetween them - #430,330.41 from Renoldi
OL,20,Fformerly of High Road in Fobbing and
OL,21,F#609,417.67 from Green who was formerly
OL,22,Fof Roland Park Avenue in Westcliff.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
