OL,3,GNEWSAPolice confiscate #1m from jailed
OL,4,Adrug dealers
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the aliases 'Typicalknee' and
OL,7,F'Harshwater' respectively, Renoldi and
OL,8,FGreen were part of a supply chain
OL,9,Finvolving kilos of cocaine, MDMA and
OL,10,Fketamine and cannabis in the UK.
